            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li><strong>Fix:</strong> Relaunching Lola from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad while it's already running now opens a Lola window, so you're no longer left with nothing to click when the menu-bar icon is hidden behind the notch.</li><li><strong>Fix:</strong> In-app update notifications now work again after a delivery issue prevented the v0.5.0 update from reaching existing users.</li></ul>]]></description>
